    <string name="settings_detailed_title">okuteekawo okw’omulala</string>
    <string name="settings_detailed_body">wagira enkwali ne okukubaganya saawa. android eyigwamu enkwali events singa pulogiramu ekolebwa, kale ayigwamu kasiya k’emiwendo. bluetooth egikomekawo mu nzira yonna.</string>
    <string name="settings_detailed_unavailable">tewali ya mu nnaku okukoma ku bluetooth: pulogiramu eno yetegeka kasiya ka connectedDevice, android 14+ esuumufu layisensi ya bluetooth.</string>
    <string name="settings_playback_only_title">obala saawa z’okukubaganya</string>
    <string name="settings_playback_only_body">okubalirira obala saawa ng’okukubaganya kwe kwaka, ssomo okukomekawo. okukola okukolebwa n’okuteekawo okw’omulala gwetegeke kubalirira; ekiya kya sibo.</string>
